{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10002_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:336ababac562bd4e41dda46491265cd4b5bbe341b8e5e830d4e0ea45ab17b045",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ee159da4c218d2dc73143b4b4afe61c399f52b024cc2ef99b814a55ee7192ba",
      "text": "会议室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4baaf1356f3f70df43aecf6b5fa9bb39c6aa5bbaed465c173729c12d5a08c02",
      "text": "……在节目里自我介绍的时候，要不要想一个\n能吸引观众注意力的专属标语？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:511b1a769c5773b4d6c84a270b2bf4417adc41d2bb4eaaaabc370d7815f871f9",
      "text": "这是个好主意呢！\n感觉能让观众对FRAME留下更深刻的印象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a486130f91541c8f823fb488f0f9517cf246c597ca3a8dd4fff9064c8d35380",
      "text": "说到标语的话，\n果然还是要有冲击力的一句话比较好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cc432dc4442c6b39b4789e25a25b1cd6d333ff9bd16c03b5b32ad50bdd311d4",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n要是想到什么点子能不能也告诉我们？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a174608b08c17e836e0b39faa9e0d9b959eef3d4393c45db5c65b01bd524acfa",
      "text": "这个嘛，如果用一句话来介绍的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000056:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:235a268715bc0e61113f1331b3a1f27a3cabc7cedfed48a943f43d0233bbc3c5",
      "text": "小虎牙就是魅力所在！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000057:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fffa2a773c2e34ceb32cd551e85c5a1f1d3cb8090b582d045e20347d86b6fd8a",
      "text": "肌肉满满！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000058:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09d635dfe253308437db193e851942461583a6fddeaad720ad5c561a22fecac4",
      "text": "不向厄运低头！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c01244cc33521d7b64ad07b1341ce258784dfadc420d3771f63167087a3a55a",
      "text": "自己夸自己是“魅力所在”吗……\n总觉得怪不好意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf354f6cbc4ba13e91bc4eb8327b57a02056d343d3d51d3f01b19cd5018e6d6c",
      "text": "嗯，作为我自身的特征很好记。\n很棒的标语！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8c5184ea19b1e63e11a11e2f8c98df01ec07021560dc6873461984ef03c1eb8",
      "text": "哇，完全就是我的心声啊。\n我可不会向厄运低头！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63638aaa11a0e500b9864d20f8853e4e427d6355d80fb63515e33d526ec2efbd",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5f8d74afcb33b95311d480c9e4d284a1b8d19c2841601930aae7c965682cca1",
      "text": "参考刚才的标语，\n我们也试着多思考几条吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeeaae06b824271da0e57837c0d4a356bf3fba4a844c068dfcad6b1d6c674441",
      "text": "说的也是。●●●●プロデューサー，\n等想出几个方案之后，再找你商量商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
